  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given limit is of the form <math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2048</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>69</mn></math></p>",
